textbook_autoformalization_batch_orchestrator_skill: Skill[TextbookTheoryAutoformalizationPreformalizationResultExistencePrecheckArtifact] = skill_artifact[TextbookTheoryAutoformalizationPreformalizationResultExistencePrecheckArtifact](
